// Original path: tests/ui/traits/default-method/bound-subst.rs
// Modifications: i32 → i64; `&self` → `self: &Self`; the second blanket
//   `impl<T> A<T> for u32` dropped (only the `i32` impl is exercised); `f`'s
//   bound moved to a where-clause; `assert_eq!` → early-return sentinels; the
